READING: generic systems have h_full = h_touch = 1 (the lonely set has full
box-dimension 1 in every base p -> loneliness with positive measure). The TIGHT
AP has |S|=0, N_full=0 (h_full=-inf) and N_touch BOUNDED (h_touch=0): the safe set
is a finite set of wall points -> the critical/zero-entropy line. So the loneliness
box-entropy h_touch is the order parameter: LRC <=> h_touch >= 0 (a safe point
exists); the extremal AP sits exactly at the h_touch: 1->0 drop. The center=shift
(odometer, zero entropy) is invisible here; the entropy is the transverse x->p
descent, independent of p (dim 1 generic / dim 0 tight in every base).
